    {
      "primary_message": "Place the contents of each salad kit in a medium bowl (reserving dressing and topping packets). ",
      "secondary_message": "2 (316 g) pkg Caesar chopped salad kit"
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Wash, dry, quarter, and core apple; thinly slice. Add to the bowl with the salad along with the dressing. Toss to combine the salad.",
      "secondary_message": "1 Gala apple"
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "To serve, divide salad between plates or bowls. Top with breadcrumbs, Parmesan, and peppered salmon. Enjoy!",
